  if (nobody.length) say += "\n\n**No chooser understood:** " + nobody.slice(0, 8).join(", ") + ".";
  return { count: chosenNow.length, scene: scene.scene, of: scene.of, title: scene.title, cast: scene.cast, called: scene.called, onStage: scene.onStage, events: scene.events, relations: scene.relations, friends: scene.friends,
    standIns: scene.standIns || [], choices: choices, strengths: strengths, summary: summary, words: words, looksFrom: memory.looksFrom, taste: scene.taste, tasteLevel: scene.tasteLevel, why: why, explain: explain, unknown: lost, say: say, memory: memory };
}

agents.pseudocode:
for each thing that happens in the scene, find the ways to show it:
  someone who is {shy}: {keeps away} from someone on stage who isn't a friend
  someone who is {mean, evil}: {chases off} someone on stage who isn't a friend
  A {dominates} B: {looms over, chases off}
  A {keeps} B from C: {stands guard}
  A {helps} B: {goes along}
  A {meets} B: {come together}
  A {-} B: {-}
  A {changes} B from X to Y: {goes to and changes}; A changes from X to Y: {comes closer bit by bit}
  A {becomes} {happy}: {faster, livelier, curvier, brighter}
  A becomes {sad}: {slower, calmer, straighter, dimmer}
cross out chases off and stands guard unless A is faster than B, and any way that needs someone who isn't on stage
cross out keeps away when A is drawn to strangers
prefer chases off when A is bigger than B, stands guard when A dominates B, and goes along and come together when A is drawn to friends
prefer a way the film hasn't used yet
a change takes {8} frames (0: at once)
if no way is left, A moves about in its own way, so its values still show; a word with no ways at all is named, for teaching
send the plan, in order, to the Director, with the values of everyone on stage

